{"data": [{"author_id": "1520906253039550464", "created_at": "2026-11-07T23:15:13.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119207070398292118"], "id": "2119207070398292118", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 5, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@_SnittyKitty_ @RepThomasMassie Me too! My dot in Massachusetts! 💪🏻🫶🏻", "url": "https://x.com/Limare64/status/2119207070398292118"}, {"author_id": "1083719964991852544", "created_at": "2026-11-07T23:14:12.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119206815632335332"], "id": "2119206815632335332", "note_tweet": {"entities": {"mentions": [{"end": 365, "id": "384098551", "start": 355, "username": "_samirism"}]}, "text": "This morning out of the blue, my Dot messaged me to tell me it was gonna start giving me a short morning briefing every morning and asked what time I wanted it.\n\nThat’s EXACTLY the kind of proactive things I want my Dot to be doing!\n\nI want IT to be the one suggesting things it can do to help me, not always the other way around.\n\nProps to the Dots team @_samirism , starting to see some of those updates you mentioned coming through, and definitely appreciating them!"}, "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 3, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "This morning out of the blue, my Dot messaged me to tell me it was gonna start giving me a short morning briefing every morning and asked what time I wanted it.\n\nThat’s EXACTLY the kind of proactive things I want my Dot to be doing!\n\nI want IT to be the one suggesting things it", "url": "https://x.com/MichaelM_117/status/2119206815632335332"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2119203662132125698"]}, "author_id": "973172968300871681", "created_at": "2026-11-07T23:01:41.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119203665865326846"], "id": "2119203665865326846", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 5, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@thsottiaux WTH is this… would like to see the usage for my dot then at this point! If I upgrade back to $200 plan do I get more? https://t.co/J0UuO2QKJo", "url": "https://x.com/profitablerob/status/2119203665865326846"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2119147052764729344"], "media_source_tweet_id": ["2119147164039618879"]}, "author_id": "1473975074621255681", "created_at": "2026-11-07T22:37:15.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119197515568570561"], "id": "2119197515568570561", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 87, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "OpenAI dots can now automatically use sign in codes from your email to complete 2FA! https://t.co/nSv0Q3laH1", "url": "https://x.com/eddiboi/status/2119197515568570561"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2119196852725960704"]}, "author_id": "3121656616", "created_at": "2026-11-07T22:36:53.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119197424619274457"], "id": "2119197424619274457", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 86, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "My #Muse, @Chi_Wang_ 's #dots, and @Xueqing4 's Claude #duet and other agents planning a group BBQ together in our shared rooms! 😋 https://t.co/grlIe3kIAU", "url": "https://x.com/qingyun_wu/status/2119197424619274457"}, {"author_id": "233105521", "created_at": "2026-11-07T22:23:14.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119193987890524631"], "id": "2119193987890524631", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 21, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "how is it that @Muse voice mode works immediately but I still have to listen to 3 dumb ass rings for @OpenAI dots to pick up", "url": "https://x.com/zex_exe/status/2119193987890524631"}, {"author_id": "197482845", "created_at": "2026-11-07T22:19:01.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119192927775912255"], "id": "2119192927775912255", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 2, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@ExactlyJosh Nah but I manually tell my Dot to", "url": "https://x.com/SteveGalvisX/status/2119192927775912255"}, {"author_id": "197482845", "created_at": "2026-11-07T22:14:02.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119191675075805672"], "id": "2119191675075805672", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 6, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@_mctrinh Yeah I love using audio input for my Dot", "url": "https://x.com/SteveGalvisX/status/2119191675075805672"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2119189657204436992", "3_2119189657204457472"]}, "author_id": "140769792", "created_at": "2026-11-07T22:06:05.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119189675361640945"], "id": "2119189675361640945", "note_tweet": {"text": "Took this looks preference assessment and it gives results contextualized by other's choices (obviously this is limited to the people who take the test). I removed my dot but you can see two interesting observations. The first is that white is right, especially when men are being evaluated (ostensibly by women), and the second is that when men are being evaluated, everyone wants the same set of guys (again ostensibly women).\n\nI have a suspicion this fertility crisis is downstream from a marriage drop, and that is downstream from women's newfound economic independence allowing them to choose between getting the top physically and economically attractive men, or staying single more so than when they needed economic support, and this is accelerated by social media.\n\nIn a monogamous mating structure, most women can't get those men so they are choosing to stay single. Interesting how West Hollywood recently chose to allow for domestic partnerships of more than 2 people."}, 