n_count": 4, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@testingcatalog Source: TestingCatalog on X: https://t.co/qpEllgtKwG #Dots", "url": "https://x.com/iCleanAI/status/2119179625498902926"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2119179486692548608"]}, "author_id": "2095946293034266624", "created_at": "2026-11-07T21:25:40.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119179502534480309"], "id": "2119179502534480309", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 14, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "OpenAI's Dots agent can now read a sign-up code from your email and finish a 2FA login for you when prompted, per tracker @testingcatalog.\n\nOpenAI hasn't announced the change, and it's not clear how widely it's rolling out.\n\n#Dots #OpenAI https://t.co/9014dHZTqA", "url": "https://x.com/iCleanAI/status/2119179502534480309"}, {"author_id": "1012142617", "created_at": "2026-11-07T21:21:29.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119178447889273058"], "id": "2119178447889273058", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 6, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@OpenAI love the product and be a fan boy since day one. But my dot can’t connect and use its cloud browser and I created a help ticket a week ago and could use some help getting it fixed.", "url": "https://x.com/MMFSFIS/status/2119178447889273058"}, {"author_id": "1866537713207230464", "created_at": "2026-11-07T21:17:10.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119177363518886349"], "id": "2119177363518886349", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 36, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@_samirism For some reason, I am not receiving push notifications from my dot. I attempted logging out and back in, and I also reinstalled the app, yet I still do not receive push notifications from my dot, even though dot push notifications are enabled in my settings.", "url": "https://x.com/CyrusTheGreat/status/2119177363518886349"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2119147052764729344"], "media_source_tweet_id": ["2119147164039618879"]}, "author_id": "1651585305869418499", "created_at": "2026-11-07T21:01:56.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119173527777755355"], "id": "2119173527777755355", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 8, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "🚨 OpenAI Dots just got smarter! 🔥\n\nDots can now grab verification codes directly from your email and use them to complete 2FA during sign-ups.\n\nLess manual work. More automation. More autonomy. 🤖⚡ https://t.co/44UEiPMUAg", "url": "https://x.com/CodingwithMagic/status/2119173527777755355"}, {"author_id": "197482845", "created_at": "2026-11-07T20:57:48.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119172491029733607"], "id": "2119172491029733607", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 0, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@jatinprajapat29 Requires a lot of patience with my Dot", "url": "https://x.com/SteveGalvisX/status/2119172491029733607"}, {"author_id": "196869292", "created_at": "2026-11-07T20:57:23.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119172385115132195"], "id": "2119172385115132195", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 6, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@JamesZmSun Hey James sent u a DM trying to fix an issue with my dot. I’d appreciate some direction on a solution. 🙏🏼", "url": "https://x.com/edwardfarinas/status/2119172385115132195"}, {"author_id": "76098307", "created_at": "2026-11-07T20:48:43.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119170201782808864"], "id": "2119170201782808864", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 11, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet